msgctxt "100"
msgid "*cough* What the hell..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Now how about you admit you were trying to scam me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Yeah, all right. I'm sure you figured it out already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Mariko plants her wallet in somebody's bag or whatever, makes a big deal out"
" of getting robbed, and convinces them to \"settle\" things with a payment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "If they don't pay up, we come out to set them straight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"A lot of people panic when they find out they have somebody else's wallet. "
"It's easy to make them pay a settlement when they're all worked up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "How did you get away with this lame scam for so long?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "It worked out fine until you showed up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Let's just go, Toru. This trick isn't gonna work anymore now that we've been"
" caught."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Maybe we could just find real jobs? I'm so afraid that one day, we're going "
"to try to scam someone dangerous who doesn't fall for it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"You should listen to her. Trying to pull crap like this in Kamurocho is a "
"good way to get yourself killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Quit now before you're bleeding out in an alley."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Don't lecture me on my own trade, old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I don't care if you want to ruin your own life, but it's not right to drag "
"your girlfriend down with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "I'm giving you a lecture for her sake, not for yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Look at how scared she is. Can't you tell that she doesn't want anything to "
"do with these schemes anymore?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Huh? Is that true, Mariko?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "It's just..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"The longer you keep this up, the more danger she'll be in. The money isn't "
"worth her life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Maybe you're right... Guess I've got some thinking to do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Let's get outta here, Mariko."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

